<Layout title="Academic Mentorship" description="Longer-term academic mentorship for students exploring interests, guided reading, coursework, work experience, and future educational directions.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Admissions / Mentorship" title="Before the application,<br />there is exploration." description="A more accessible, longer-term approach for students who want to understand their interests and the possibilities ahead." />
  <div class="container"><section class="split-content"><h2>Build a vocabulary<br />for your choices.</h2><div><p>Related degrees can sound alike while offering very different ways of thinking. Mentorship makes room to explore those differences through guided reading, discussion, and reflective work.</p><p>The aim is to help students discover what interests them and why, rather than assemble activities for an application.</p></div></section><section class="split-content"><h2>What we can explore.</h2><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Academic interests</span><span class="tag">Guided reading</span><span class="tag">Coursework planning</span><span class="tag">Work experience</span><span class="tag">Extracurricular activities</span><span class="tag">Academic competitions</span><span class="tag">Differences between disciplines</span><span class="tag">Long-term educational planning</span></div></section><section class="split-content"><h2>A steady conversation.</h2><div><p>Live consultations and asynchronous feedback are tailored to the student's stage and questions. Format, frequency, scope, confidentiality, and pricing are discussed before work begins. The overall practice is limited to five active clients per month.</p><a class="text-link" href="/admissions/process/">Read the educational philosophy <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></a><br /><a class="button" style="margin-top:25px" href="/admissions/book/">Enquire about mentorship <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></span></a></div></section></div>
</Layout>
